'''Ben Tennyson''' is the alternate version of [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben Tennyson]] from [[Race Against Time Timeline|'''''Race Against Time''''' Timeline]]. He served as the protagonist of '''''[[Ben 10: Race Against Time]]'''''.

==Appearance==
Ben has fair skin, green eyes, and shaggy brown hair. He wears the prototype [[Omnitrix (Original)|Omnitrix]] on his left wrist and wears black sneakers on his feet. He is seen wearing 3 different outfits.

In the beginning, Ben wears a dark blue raglan shirt with lighter blue sleeves and blue and white vertically-striped pajama pants.

When he starts going to school, he wears a brown hooded jacket over a red polo shirt and white undershirt, and khaki pants.

In the gym, he wears a beige jumper and blue shorts.

The next day, Ben wears his brown jacket over an orange t-shirt with a black and white stripe over it and dark blue jeans. He discards the jacket when he visits the Café.

For the rest of the movie, he wears his trademark black-striped, white shirt with short-sleeves, dark blue jeans, and black sneakers.

In '''[[Ben 10: Ultimate Alien (TV Series)|Ultimate Alien]]''', Ben looks the same as 10-year-old Ben Prime in ''[[The Forge of Creation]]''.<gallery>
